{"id":"b06e23b6b7eb5f37","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Node2a2.md","title":"Node2a2","display":"Node2a2","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Node2a2","parameters":["x0","x1","z"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Node2a2"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>x0</span><span>x1</span><span>z</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>x0</code>、<code>x1</code>、<code>z</code>。</p>\n<p>带自然数标签的集合构造子；不同标签分离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Node2a2 x0 x1 z)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z5 (exists z6 (and (@ Num2 z5) (and (@ Pair x0 x1 z6) (@ Pair z5 z6 z)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Node2a2 x0 x1 z)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num2","status":"resolved","id":"36fc33b3a64f5aa9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":805,"backlinks":[{"id":"eabdafb75566a144","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_Node1a1|Node1a1]]；[[ZFC_Node2a2|Node2a2]]"},{"id":"4a1c0902ef42ab95","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]；[[ZFC_FSafeSub|FSafeSub]]；[[ZFC_FSig|FSig]]；[[ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Node1a1|Node1a1]]；[[ZFC_Node2a2|Node2a2]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]"},{"id":"328ce1732932c40d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_Node2a2|Node2a2]]；[[ZFC_Node3a0|Node3a0]]；[[ZFC_Node5a2|Node5a2]]；[[ZFC_Node6a2|Node6a2]]"},{"id":"a3ba1aacd08ebfaa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_Node2a2|Node2a2]]；[[ZFC_Node3a0|Node3a0]]；[[ZFC_Node5a2|Node5a2]]；[[ZFC_Node6a2|Node6a2]]"},{"id":"3a58c41644729e72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_Node2a2|Node2a2]]；[[ZFC_Node3a0|Node3a0]]；[[ZFC_Node5a2|Node5a2]]；[[ZFC_Node6a2|Node6a2]]"},{"id":"6f226bfb5fcb432c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_Node1a1|Node1a1]]；[[ZFC_Node2a2|Node2a2]]；[[ZFC_Node3a0|Node3a0]]；[[ZF